      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The therapeutic efficacy and changes of clinical and hemodynamic indices due to the use of long-action nitrates were studied in 91 patients with chronic ischemic heart disease. The native drug nitrogranulong produces an essential effect on the hemodynamics resulting in a complete disappearance or reduction of stenocardia attacks, increased tolerance to physical loads as evidenced by bicycle ergometric data."},
